\\n...(includeProcessSuite ? { testTimeout: 30000, hookTimeout: 30000 } : {}),\\n```\\n\\nThis mirrors the existing convention — every *editable* process file already sets explicit per-test timeouts (30s floor; 60s/120s for compaction-heavy legs). Those per-test values override this global, so the heavy legs are untouched. The 30s floor only applies when `LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1`; plain `verify` keeps the tight 5s default so unit tests stay fast and a real hang surfaces quickly.\\n\\n**Why this doesn't weaken Story 1.** No hash-locked test was edited (the assertions and the focused passing behavior are unchanged — it's purely wall-clock headroom for subprocess spawns), and the config file isn't in the red manifest.\\n\\n**Verification:**\\n- `LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1 vitest run test/cli-process-report-repair.test.ts` → 3 passed (focused behavior preserved)\\n- `pnpm verify-all` → **40 files / 337 tests passed**; build, typecheck, lint, boundaries all OK\\n- `pnpm green-verify` → 300 tests pass + `test-immutability: OK (43 Red-phase files unchanged)` — confirms Story 1's red-manifest immutability is intact\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":888,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":52659,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":888},\"output_tokens\":5,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"468b9ce0-fb77-433b-844d-36c8f728df81\",\"uuid\":\"ce87b046-0434-4001-b126-76a451fbdc4e\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CbyVaj9ft4gYK2JfHRdLs\"}\n{\"type\":\"stream_event\",\"event\":{\"type\":\"content_block_stop\",\"index\":1},\"session_id\":\"468b9ce0-fb77-433b-844d-36c8f728df81\",\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"uuid\":\"3accf846-b2ff-40e4-b4a6-99ef65d0e769\"}\n{\"type\":\"stream_event\",\"event\":{\"type\":\"message_delta\",\"delta\":{\"stop_reason